<section>
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item colspan="7" background-color="accent" padding="34pt 12pt 30pt">
      <p role="eyebrow">Field guide</p>
      <spacer mode="fill"/>
      <p role="caption">CONTEXT</p>
      <p role="caption">02 / 10</p>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="53" padding="0">
      <grid spacing="none">
        <grid-item colspan="20" padding="0">
          <ai-image prompt="Editorial studio photograph of three distinct paper input channels converging into one operational-blue intake tray, duplicate graphite slips set aside, a small signal-amber priority tab and field-sage acknowledgement card, soft directional daylight on warm white, precise modular arrangement, no text, lettering, people, logos, or screens" image-style="operational-still-life" aspect-ratio="portrait" fill="true"/>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="40" padding="34pt 40pt 30pt">
          <labels><label variant="outline">Illustrative replacement · validate before use</label></labels>
          <h2>Why the project exists and what success means</h2>
          <p>Support requests arrive through email, chat, and inconsistent web forms. Manual triage creates duplicate records, weak priority signals, and limited visibility into queue health.</p>
          <p>The project creates one traceable intake and routing service without replacing the underlying case-management platform.</p>
          <grid spacing="small">
            <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle">
              <p role="eyebrow">User outcome</p>
              <h3>≤15 minutes</h3>
              <p font-size="sm">Acknowledgement and a valid case reference.</p>
            </grid-item>
            <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle">
              <p role="eyebrow">Operational outcome</p>
              <h3>≥90%</h3>
              <p font-size="sm">Requests reach the correct queue without manual rerouting.</p>
            </grid-item>
            <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle">
              <p role="eyebrow">Reporting outcome</p>
              <h3>95%</h3>
              <p font-size="sm">Dashboard updates complete within two hours.</p>
            </grid-item>
            <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle">
              <p role="eyebrow">Control outcome</p>
              <h3>Attributable</h3>
              <p font-size="sm">Every priority override links to an authorized role.</p>
            </grid-item>
          </grid>
          <p role="caption">Illustrative acceptance thresholds, not measured results. Non-goals: CRM replacement, staffing redesign, an automated support bot, or customer-service policy changes.</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>